+	/**
+	 * Retrieve the <code>Vet</code>s holding the given specialty, matched by whole name
+	 * case-insensitively, from data store in Pages. The <code>IgnoreCase</code> keyword
+	 * makes the match vendor-neutral (<code>upper(name) = upper(?)</code>) rather than
+	 * relying on column collation.
